<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/schema/JurisdictionType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Jurisdiction type, namespaced per country (§11.1, §13.7, SIG-ONTO-068). The dotless terms are the shared abstract levels every country's hierarchy maps onto; national levels are `<cc>.*` children linked by `is_a`, so a new country plugs its own level names in without widening a US-shaped enum." .
