<https://ontology.surveillancegraph.org/schema/LegalInstrumentType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Legal instrument type, internationalized and country-namespaced (§11.14, §13.7, SIG-ONTO-068). The dotless terms are the shared abstract parents; national instruments are `<cc>.*` children linked by `is_a`, added under a national namespace rather than by widening a US-shaped enum (§5.3). P18.2 is the first consumer (the French arrêté préfectoral / CNIL decision)." .
